CLASSIFICATION AMBIGUITIES
- extension .json: also associated with OASv2-json, OASv3-json
- extension .ice: also associated with Slice
- extension .tact: also associated with Tact
- extension .yy: also associated with Yacc
- filename .releaserc: also associated with YAML
A shared spelling is not proof of a language. GitHub also uses filename rules, interpreters, heuristics and classification when no explicit override applies. This reference does not run those interpreters or validate a grammar.

